# xTB pre-optimisation, CREST conformer search, DFT refinement.
recipe: xtb-crest
title: xTB first, then conformers
field: Conformations
summary: xTB optimisation, then a CREST conformer search, then DFT optimisation and frequencies
description: A rough structure from the Builder is optimised with xTB first, so CREST starts from a sensible geometry; CREST searches the conformers and a DFT optimisation with frequencies refines the lowest one.
role: dft | DFT optimisation and frequencies | B3LYP | 6-31+G(d) | the usual starting level; diffuse functions when the molecule is an anion
rules: anion-diffuse, heavy-ecp, size, registered

